OL,3,GNEWSASeeing shop fire like being
OL,4,A'punched', owner says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owners of businesses in East Sussex
OL,7,Faffected by an incident in which a car
OL,8,Fhit a shopfront and then caught fire
OL,9,Fhave described the situation as
OL,10,F"devastating", "a huge shock" and "a
OL,11,Fbit of a blur".
OL,13,FAt about 02:25 BST on Sunday, East
OL,14,FSussex Fire and Rescue Service attended
OL,15,Fa vehicle fire on Sutton Road in
OL,16,FSeaford that later spread.
OL,18,FSue Bedford, owner of drycleaners The
OL,19,FIron Lady, was on holiday when the car
OL,20,Fhit her business and on returning was
OL,21,Fshocked at "how small and black" her
OL,22,Fshop looked.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
