OL,3,GNEWSASeeing shop fire like being
OL,4,A'punched', owner says
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe told BBC Radio Sussex: "When my
OL,7,Fdaughter drove me past, it was like
OL,8,Fgetting punched really...devastating is
OL,9,Fthe only way I can describe it."
